# Eris Bot Command Routing

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `Config/workspace.json` at the start of Eris work.
- Load `.codex/skills/eris-challenge-automation/SKILL.md` for `Ready`, `Status`, `Status & Fix`, or `Create X Task(s)`.
- Use `eris_automation/run.ps1` as the durable controller.
- Never claim live Shipd status from local files; `Status` requires a fresh authenticated read-only inspection.
- Preserve exact task counts and IDs. Revisions never count as new tasks.
- Resolve yellow and red checks substantively and preserve all factory, submission, and action-time confirmation gates.
